ps://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check modifier of +13.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," takes damage that exceeds its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," (if any) in a round when a Droid Repair Team is active, there's a 25% chance that the Droid Repair Team is destroyed.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
